## A site:  pages people move between by address, and the dialogs and sidebars any of its pages opens
// Built into spell (epic `mockup` P1):  compiled once, into the core's `Site`.
// A site made from it lists its parts in its body, `- it has a film page at "/films/:film", named "Film"`,
// `- it has a settings dialog`:  the site holds each page's address and name, never the page itself,
// so a page moves to another address, or gets a name in another language, without its own file changing.
a "site" is an app where:
	// the address of the page it's showing:  "/" when it starts
	- its "current address" is a text starting at "/"
